_summary":"A supervised reading room for university archives, manuscripts and rare regional materials.","evidence_claim":"Louisiana Tech requires Special Collections materials to be consulted in the fourth-floor reading room and recommends appointments because access may be limited.","source_url":"https://www.latech.edu/academics/library/special-collections/about.php","source_title":"About Special Collections","source_kind":"university_official","source_published_at":null,"source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":null,"access_notes":"Appointment recommended; walk-ins may face restrictions. Bring picture ID. Current hours are Monday–Thursday 8 a.m.–4:30 p.m. and Friday 8 a.m.–noon.","cost_status":"not_applicable","under21_safe":true},{"subject_id":"latech-college-of-business-study-niches","subject_type":"study_space","entity_name":"College of Business Study Niches","title":"Choose a Quiet Nook or Balcony in the Business Building","subtitle":"Across three floors of the College of Business","notes":"Walk the three floors to match the task to a setting: use a quiet niche for solo reading or a collaborative area when conversation is necessary.","short_summary":"A mix of quiet niches, balconies and collaborative areas inside the business building.","evidence_claim":"The College of Business says its three floors contain collaborative learning spaces, balconies, quiet study nooks, six breakout rooms and 24/7 student access.","source_url":"https://www.latech.edu/business/about/index.php","source_title":"About the College of Business","source_kind":"university_official","source_published_at":null,"source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":null,"access_notes":"The college states that students have 24/7 building access. Room-specific availability or reservation rules are not published on the cited page.","cost_status":"not_applicable","under21_safe":true},{"subject_id":"latech-iesb-dynamic-learning-areas","sub